{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":23146105,"ns":0,"title":"Clutch delay valve","extract":"A clutch delay valve is an automotive component added to the clutch system of an automobile to control clutch engagement speed.  Its purpose is to engage the drivetrain of an automobile without introducing shock to the drivetrain components by engaging too quickly.","description":"Automotive component","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}